[Term]
id: CCTO:000372 
name: Conduction disorder 
def: "A disorder affecting the conduction system that sends electrical signals in the myocardium OR A disorder characterized by pathological irregularities in the cardiac conduction system." [NCIT:C78245, NCI:CTCAE] 
