[Term]
id: CCTO:000388 
name: Right ventricular dysfunction 
def: "A disorder characterized by impairment of right ventricular function associated with low ejection fraction and a decrease in motility of the right ventricular wall OR Impairment of the right ventricular function associated with low ejection fraction and decreased motility of the right ventricular wall." [NCI:CTCAE, NCIT:C50733] 
synonym: "Dysfunction, right ventricular" EXACT [NCIT:C50733] 
