[Term]
id: CCTO:000420 
name: Dry eye 
def: "A syndrome characterized by dryness of the cornea and conjunctiva. It is usually caused by a deficiency in tear production. Symptoms include a feeling of burning eyes and a possible foreign body presence in the eye OR A disorder characterized by dryness of the cornea and conjunctiva." [NCIT:C34553, NCI:CTCAE] 
