[Term]
id: CCTO:000425 
name: Floaters 
def: "Spots before the eyes caused by opaque cell fragments in the vitreous humor or lens OR Spots before the eyes caused by opaque cell fragments in the vitreous humor or lens OR A disorder characterized by an individual seeing spots before their eyes. The spots are shadows of opaque cell fragments in the vitreous humor or lens." [NCIT:C50808, NCIT:C37955, NCI:CTCAE] 
synonym: "Floaters, vitreous" EXACT [NCIT:C50808] 
