[Term]
id: CCTO:000436 
name: Scleral disorder 
def: "A disorder affecting the sclera. Examples include inflammatory processes (e.g., scleritis and episcleritis), and degenerative processes. Primary tumors of the sclera are extremely rare OR A disorder characterized by involvement of the sclera of the eye." [NCIT:C79717, NCI:CTCAE] 
