name: Vomiting 
def: "A question about whether an individual has been vomiting OR A question about an individual's distress from their vomiting OR A disorder characterized by the reflexive act of ejecting the contents of the stomach through the mouth OR A question about whether an individual is or was bothered by vomiting OR A question about the usual severity of an individual's vomiting OR A question about how often an individual vomits or vomited OR Forceful ejection of the contents of the stomach through the mouth." [NCIT:C115346, NCIT:C125342, NCI:CTCAE, NCIT:C125647, NCIT:C125310, NCIT:C125278, NCIT:C3442] 
