[Term]
id: CCTO:000643 
name: Pharyngitis 
def: "A disorder characterized by of marked discomfort in the throat OR Inflammation of the throat most often caused by viral and bacterial infections. Other causes include allergens, chemical substances, and trauma OR Any kind of inflammatory process of the tonsils, pharynx, or/and larynx characterized by pain in swallowing." [NCI:CTCAE, NCIT:C26851, NCIT:C50747] 
synonym: "Sore throat" EXACT [NCIT:C50747] 
synonym: "Throat, sore" EXACT [NCIT:C50747] 
