[Term]
id: CCTO:000659 
name: Tracheitis 
def: "An inflammatory process affecting the wall of the trachea OR Bacterial infectious process with formation of mucopurulent membranes affecting the trachea. Causative agents include Staphylococcus, Streptococcus, Haemophilus influenzae, Pseudomonas, and Klebsiella OR A disorder characterized by an infectious process involving the trachea." [NCIT:C78643, NCIT:C78647, NCI:CTCAE] 
synonym: "Bacterial tracheitis" EXACT [NCIT:C78647] 
synonym: "Tracheal inflammation" EXACT [NCIT:C78643] 
