def: "Painful sensation in the face, between the eyes, or upper teeth originating from the sinuses. It is usually caused by sinus infections OR A disorder characterized by marked discomfort in the face, between the eyes, or upper teeth originating from the sinuses." [NCIT:C78609, NCI:CTCAE] 
