[Term]
id: CCTO:000903 
name: Transient ischemic attacks 
def: "A disorder characterized by a brief attack (less than 24 hours) of cerebral dysfunction of vascular origin, with no persistent neurological deficit OR A brief attack (from a few minutes to an hour) of cerebral dysfunction of vascular origin, with no persistent neurological deficit." [NCI:CTCAE, NCIT:C50781] 
