[Term]
id: CCTO:000909 
name: Fetal growth retardation 
def: "A disorder characterized by inhibition of fetal growth resulting in the inability of the fetus to achieve its potential weight OR A fetus that does not grow beyond the 10th percentile of conventionally accepted weight for gestational age." [NCI:CTCAE, NCIT:C114875] 
