[Term]
id: CCTO:000974 
name: Premature menopause 
def: "A disorder characterized by ovarian failure before the age of 40. Symptoms include hot flashes, night sweats, mood swings and a decrease in sex drive OR Cessation of menstruation before the age of 40. Symptoms include hot flashes, night sweats, mood swings, and decreased sex drive." [NCI:CTCAE, NCIT:C80099] 
synonym: "POF" EXACT [NCIT:C80099] 
synonym: "Premature ovarian failure" EXACT [NCIT:C80099] 
synonym: "early menopause" EXACT [NCIT:C80099] 
