[Term]
id: CCTO:000989 
name: Vaginal dryness 
def: "An uncomfortable feeling of itching and burning in the vaginal opening resulting from inadequate vaginal lubrication. It is commonly seen during and after menopause, childbirth, or stressful conditions. It results in painful intercourse OR A disorder characterized by an uncomfortable feeling of itching and burning in the vagina OR A question about whether an individual is or was bothered by vaginal dryness." [NCIT:C78699, NCI:CTCAE, NCIT:C125650] 
synonym: "Bothered by Vaginal Dryness" EXACT [NCIT:C125650] 
synonym: "Vaginal dryness adverse event" EXACT [NCIT:C55645] 
