[Term]
id: CCTO:001095 
name: Peripheral ischemia 
def: "A disorder characterized by impaired circulation to an extremity OR Deficient blood distribution to the limbs caused by narrowing or obstruction of the lumen of the peripheral arteries." [NCI:CTCAE, NCIT:C78535] 
xref: UMLS:C0235490
xref: NCI:CTCAE:10034578 
